# Vue 3 Composition API

- Use `<script setup lang="ts">` for component logic
- Use `ref` and `reactive` for reactive state
- Use `computed()` for derived values
- Use `watch` / `watchEffect` for side effects
- Use lifecycle hooks (`onMounted`, `onUnmounted`, …)
- Use `provide` / `inject` only when a composable is not enough
- Define props and emits explicitly
- Use Vue Router lazy `import()` for pages
- Use Vite for dev and build
- Follow the Vue 3 style guide and naming conventions
